### StarVoice Lanka - API requests
### Group 2026-Y2-S1-KU-03
###
### Open this in VS Code with the REST Client extension, or in the JetBrains
### HTTP client, and click "Send Request" above each block. Run them top to
### bottom the first time - later requests reuse ids from earlier ones.
###
### Start the server first:  npm run seed && npm start

@host = http://localhost:4000/api

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Health check - run this before anything else
### ------------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{host}}/health

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### User Management (UM) - Balasuriya B.A.K.K. IT25100192
### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### UM01 Register a voter account
# @name register
POST {{host}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Chamodi Senanayake",
  "email": "chamodi@example.lk",
  "mobile": "0771112233",
  "nic": "200145600789",
  "password": "voter12345"
}

### UM03 Verify the account
### The 6-digit code is printed in the server console by the notification
### stub - copy it from there into the "code" field below.
POST {{host}}/users/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "chamodi@example.lk",
  "code": "000000"
}

### UM02 Log in as a seeded voter
# @name login
POST {{host}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "voter1@starvoice.lk",
  "password": "voter12345"
}

### Capture the token from the login response
@voterToken = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### UM02 Log in as the admin
# @name adminLogin
POST {{host}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@starvoice.lk",
  "password": "admin12345"
}

@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### UM04 View your own profile
GET {{host}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{voterToken}}

### UM04 Update your profile
PATCH {{host}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{voterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nimali Fernando",
  "mobile": "0779998877"
}

### UM05 Request a password reset code
POST {{host}}/users/password/forgot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "voter1@starvoice.lk"
}

### UM06 List all users (admin only)
GET {{host}}/users?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### UM06 Suspend an account (admin only)
### Replace :id with a user id from the list above
PATCH {{host}}/users/REPLACE_USER_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "SUSPENDED"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Contestant Management (CM) - Siriwardhana W.M.B.B.B. IT25100187
### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### Current season
GET {{host}}/rounds/seasons/current

### CM03 List rounds
# @name rounds
GET {{host}}/rounds

### Grab the first round id
@roundId = {{rounds.response.body.data.0._id}}

### Public contestant list
# @name contestants
GET {{host}}/contestants

@contestantId = {{contestants.response.body.data.0._id}}

### One contestant
GET {{host}}/contestants/{{contestantId}}

### CM01 Register a new contestant (admin only)
POST {{host}}/contestants
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Yasas Karunaratne",
  "stageName": "Yasas K",
  "age": 23,
  "district": "Ratnapura",
  "bio": "Baila and folk fusion from Ratnapura."
}

### CM02 Update a contestant (admin only)
PATCH {{host}}/contestants/{{contestantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "Updated during the live show."
}

### CM03 Create a round (admin only)
POST {{host}}/rounds
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Semi Final",
  "sequence": 2,
  "advanceCount": 2
}

### CM03 Set the line-up for a round (admin only, round must be DRAFT)
POST {{host}}/rounds/REPLACE_ROUND_ID/line-up
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contestantIds": ["REPLACE_ID_1", "REPLACE_ID_2", "REPLACE_ID_3"]
}

### CM04 Leaderboard for a round - public
GET {{host}}/rounds/{{roundId}}/leaderboard

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Payment Management (PM) - Nawarathna I.K.H.G.B. IT25100174
### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### PM01 Vote bundle price list - public
GET {{host}}/payments/bundles

### Current credit balance
GET {{host}}/payments/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{voterToken}}

### PM02 Buy a bundle - this one succeeds
# @name purchase
POST {{host}}/payments/purchase
Authorization: Bearer {{voterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bundleCode": "FAN",
  "method": "CARD",
  "card": "4111111111111111"
}

@paymentId = {{purchase.response.body.data.payment._id}}

### PM02 Buy a bundle - card ending 0000 is the declined path
POST {{host}}/payments/purchase
Authorization: Bearer {{voterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bundleCode": "STARTER",
  "method": "CARD",
  "card": "4111111111110000"
}

### PM03 Your own transaction history
GET {{host}}/payments/me
Authorization: Bearer {{voterToken}}

### PM03 All transactions (admin only)
GET {{host}}/payments?status=SUCCESS
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### PM05 Receipt
GET {{host}}/payments/{{paymentId}}/receipt
Authorization: Bearer {{voterToken}}

### PM04 Refund (admin only, fails if the credits were already spent)
POST {{host}}/payments/{{paymentId}}/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Duplicate purchase reported by the voter"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Voting Management (VM) - Ahamed M.N.N. IT25100183
### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### VM02 Check eligibility before voting
### Tells you the free/paid split and whether the balance covers it
GET {{host}}/votes/eligibility/{{roundId}}?count=8
Authorization: Bearer {{voterToken}}

### VM01 Cast a vote
### This single request touches four modules - see castVote() in
### src/modules/voting/voting.service.js
POST {{host}}/votes
Authorization: Bearer {{voterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roundId": "{{roundId}}",
  "contestantId": "{{contestantId}}",
  "count": 3
}

### VM03 Live tally - public. Includes the sponsor banners (SM04)
GET {{host}}/votes/tally/{{roundId}}

### VM05 Your own voting history
GET {{host}}/votes/me
Authorization: Bearer {{voterToken}}

### VM04 Open a round for voting (admin only)
POST {{host}}/votes/rounds/REPLACE_ROUND_ID/open
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### VM04 Close a round (admin only)
POST {{host}}/votes/rounds/REPLACE_ROUND_ID/close
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Full vote ledger for a round (admin only)
GET {{host}}/votes/rounds/{{roundId}}/ledger
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Void a vote (admin only)
POST {{host}}/votes/REPLACE_VOTE_ID/void
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Flagged as duplicate during the fraud review"
}

### CM05 Publish results - close the round first
POST {{host}}/rounds/REPLACE_ROUND_ID/publish-results
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Notification Management (NM) - De Silva T.J.T. IT25100158
### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### NM05 Your in-app notifications
GET {{host}}/notifications?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{voterToken}}

### NM05 Unread only
GET {{host}}/notifications?unread=true
Authorization: Bearer {{voterToken}}

### NM05 Mark one as read
PATCH {{host}}/notifications/REPLACE_NOTIFICATION_ID/read
Authorization: Bearer {{voterToken}}

### NM05 Mark everything as read
POST {{host}}/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{voterToken}}

### NM04 Current channel preferences
GET {{host}}/notifications/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{voterToken}}

### NM04 Mute SMS but keep email and in-app
PATCH {{host}}/notifications/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{voterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sms": false,
  "announcements": true
}

### NM03 Broadcast to every active voter (admin only)
POST {{host}}/notifications/broadcast
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "template": "ROUND_OPENED",
  "payload": {
    "roundName": "Semi Final",
    "closesAt": "Sunday 10pm",
    "contestantCount": 3
  }
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Sponsor & Partnership Management (SM) - Weerasinghe W.A.D.S. IT25100176
### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### SM02 Sponsorship rate card - public
GET {{host}}/sponsors/packages

### SM02 Create a package (admin only)
POST {{host}}/sponsors/packages
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tier": "BRONZE",
  "name": "Bronze Partner",
  "priceLKR": 300000,
  "guaranteedImpressions": 20000,
  "bannerSlotsPerRound": 1
}

### SM01 Register a sponsor (admin only)
# @name sponsor
POST {{host}}/sponsors
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Lanka Beverages",
  "industry": "FMCG",
  "website": "https://example.lk",
  "contactName": "Dilshan Amarasinghe",
  "contactEmail": "brand@example.lk",
  "contactPhone": "0112223344"
}

@sponsorId = {{sponsor.response.body.data._id}}

### SM01 List sponsors
GET {{host}}/sponsors
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### SM03 Create an agreement (admin only)
# @name agreement
POST {{host}}/sponsors/agreements
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sponsorId": "{{sponsorId}}",
  "packageTier": "GOLD",
  "startsAt": "2026-09-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-12-31T00:00:00.000Z",
  "clickThroughUrl": "https://example.lk/starvoice"
}

@agreementId = {{agreement.response.body.data._id}}

### SM03 Activate the agreement (admin only)
POST {{host}}/sponsors/agreements/{{agreementId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### SM03 List agreements
GET {{host}}/sponsors/agreements?status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### SM04 Banners for a round - this is what the vote page calls
GET {{host}}/sponsors/banners/{{roundId}}

### SM04 Record a click on a banner
POST {{host}}/sponsors/agreements/{{agreementId}}/click

### SM05 Exposure report - impressions, clicks, cost per impression
GET {{host}}/sponsors/agreements/{{agreementId}}/report
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### SM06 Terminate an agreement (admin only)
POST {{host}}/sponsors/agreements/{{agreementId}}/terminate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Sponsor withdrew ahead of the semi final"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Error paths worth demonstrating in the viva
### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### Missing token
GET {{host}}/users/me

### Voter hitting an admin-only endpoint
GET {{host}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{voterToken}}

### Validation failure - short password, bad mobile format
POST {{host}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "AB",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "mobile": "12345",
  "password": "123"
}

### Voting for a contestant who is not in the round
POST {{host}}/votes
Authorization: Bearer {{voterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roundId": "{{roundId}}",
  "contestantId": "000000000000000000000000",
  "count": 1
}

### Route that does not exist
GET {{host}}/nonsense
